# Web3Forms access key. The live one comes from the Web3Forms dashboard
# (https://app.web3forms.com — account 3nityccs@gmail.com, form "My First
# Form", created 2026-10-04) and is already set in Vercel (project 3nity-web,
# all environments). The key is bound to that account's inbox — that's what
# determines where submissions land, not any code here. Locally you only need
# it to test real submissions; builds work without it (see index.astro).
PUBLIC_W3F_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
